READY
>0 PRINT "LINE ZERO"
>1 ON 2 GOSUB 100,200
>2 PRINT "MAIN DONE": END
>100 PRINT "SUB100": RETURN
>200 PRINT "SUB200": RETURN
>RUN
LINE ZERO
SUB200
MAIN DONE
