>NEW
READY
>10 A$="AB": B$="AC"
>20 PRINT A$<B$; A$=A$; "Z">"A"; LEFT$("HI",99); VAL(""); VAL("  -3.5X")
>RUN
-1 -1 -1 HI 0  0 
